ust like yeah he won't be coming back  for like he's been gone a long time but  they have a kind of argument but then  daryl's just kind of like okay fine  whatever man it's your weed it's your  brother so what they decide to do though  is they decide to take the katana um and  decide that they're gonna go [ __ ] around  with it so they go kind of out to this  uh empty field and they're gonna slice  milk cartons open and you know they're  just kind of like quarreling about  stupid teenage boy [ __ ] like about girls  and about superheroes and all that kind  of stuff however a problem soon arises  uh when they discover that daryl  absolutely stole all the weed from  josh's brother's bedroom and it's like  sitting there smoking it like a dumbass  i think that kind of  i think we're meant to assume like he  doesn't seem like he's uh i don't know  like daryl seems like maybe he's not  slow necessarily but maybe not the  sharpest tool in the shed you know what  i mean i don't want to like overstate  that but because he obviously stole all  this weed and then he just sits there  and feels full view of everybody like  smoking it and just no no it's just a  regular cigarette and i'm just like yeah  that's not gonna fly but anyway so uh so  he starts smoking it and obviously like  josh gets really mad um because he's  like hey i told you not to take that so  they get into this really big heated  argument which ends with josh kind of  accidentally uh stabbing daryl in the  throat with the katana  now the boys all understandably freak  out uh and try to kind of stem the tide  of blood that's coming out of this kid's  neck and they wig out even more as you  would when daryl who seems to be running  like purely on adrenal at this point  like actually gets up like gets onto his  feet and like runs off into the woods so  they chase him obviously but by the time  they catch up to him uh daryl has bled  out and is just laying there dead on the  forest floor  so  the three other boys are like what the  [ __ ] do we do now they're completely  panicked so they're like well you know  no one's gonna believe this is an  accident what's you know what are we  gonna do so they decide well we're gonna  hide the body and the sword and now  we're gonna like pretend that we have no  idea what happened and no idea where  this kid went to because like i said  they weren't  they sort of knew each other like that  they went to the same school but they  didn't like hang out together so it  wouldn't like be really obvious that you  know they didn't usually hang out with  that kid so it wouldn't be really  obvious that like people were like hey  where'd that kid go so from that point  in the movie onward uh sort of like the  friendship between josh and zach  starts crumbling i guess as each of them  is just trying to deal with this secret  in their own way and like i said the  other kid charlie neither of them really  knew him either and he's like younger so  he doesn't go to the same school as them  so he's just kind of like whatever like  we're not friends and like stop talking  to me so he just kind of like goes and  does his own thing  now zach who seems to be like more of an  empathetic person he's actually like  consumed by guilt he's thinking about oh  my god like daryl's mother must be  worried sick about him and it's like you  know everybody thinks the kid is just  missing because obviously they haven't  found the body and he's like but i know  where he is and i know what happened to  him and it's like eating him up inside  that he can't tell anybody about it and  so he's almost kind of like tempted i  don't think that he necessarily wants to  report it he never says that but he does  say a couple of times that that they  should go back  to  um to the spot where they left the body  and like check on it or you know or do  something you know he he's he seems like  he wants to do something about it which  i think maybe is like a low-key way that  maybe he wants to get caught so he  doesn't have to worry about it anymore  he's also really conflicted by the fact  because this is another little side plot  that this girl that he's like totally in  love with his name is allison has kind  of like started flirting back and like  returning his feelings hey i really like  you and stuff like that too and he's  still a teenage boy so he really really  wants to pursue this but obviously he  has this horrible horrific secret that's  just like eating him up and killing him  inside and he's just too emotionally  distraught to  return the feelings as much as he wants  to and you know he really wants to tell  her like why he's being that way but he  can't because he'll get in trouble now  josh on the other hand who was more  directly responsible for the kid dying  uh actually locks himself away in his  room for several days like telling his  mom that he's really sick and but then  when he comes back out of his room like  when he emerges and goes back to school  he sort of acts like nothing happened  like that's kind of how he's dealing  with it he's just like yeah whatever and  he's just like acting all cool and  everything um but he does seem to be  like lashing out or like acting out in  ways that he didn't really before like  he's getting in trouble at school like  he calls his teacher like a [ __ ] and  stuff like that which he wouldn't have  done before because he was more of a  quiet kid so  that's kind of how his stress is coming  out in that way um and he's just  generally acting sort of off so  obviously like him like zach and uh josh  aren't really talking that much anymore  because they're dealing with this  with what happened in like such a  different way and they can't really  communicate and so but zack starts to  get really worried when another  classmate of theirs uh who josh  absolutely despised  turns up dead also like in an apparent  accident or suicide and zack starts to  suspect that maybe josh had something to  do with it  so as i mentioned uh this is actually  way more like a dark thriller about  teenage relationships and murder than a  traditional horror film but i actually  think that certain types of horror fans  will probably really dig it like i said  especially if you like stuff like donnie  darko or stand by me or river's edge or  something like that which like i said  are not necessarily horror films but  they have like real dark themes to them  so i think if you liked those you would  probably like this as well like i said  it has that kind of like dark nostalgia  kind of uh deal to it as well and it has  like this real ominous vibe  to it that makes you like the whole time  you're watching it you just feel like  things could spiral out of control like  at any minute because you're not really  sure  what exactly is going to happen like how  this is all going to play out  so i mean the acting is impeccable i  guess it's very very naturalistic and it  really kind of uh evoked that era for me  because i was like yeah i remember like  teenage boys acting like that and  talking like that uh the cinematography  is beautiful um even though it's very  very forbidding like i said it's almost  kind of like almost post-apocalyptic  like the way that it's shot and i will  give a special shout out here too to the  score and also like the musical choices  like the songs they used their songs by  uh black flag bad religion wire the  comsat angels i think pm dawn was in  there stuff like that and it really set  this kind of like somber but also kind  of like real anxiety inducing like mood  and it really really took me back to  that time because like i said 90s 92  something like that i was just out of  high school like i was in college at  that time so this this arrow is like  really a hype in my mind so i was kind  of like just a little bit older than  these kids would have been so there was  like a lot that i could relate to from  this uh but yeah this is a really really  good one if you really really like kind  of like dark dramas especially about you  know [ __ ] up stuff happening to like  teenagers uh then i would definitely  recommend it to anybody that was into  that kind of stuff uh i really really  enjoyed it so if you've seen it like let  me know what you thought about it in the  comments and that will do it for this  flickers of fear i will see you again on  the next one bye
 

